FAIL testdata/bad/max-concurrent.yaml:2:17  PQ1030: max_concurrent is 0, and the lowest it goes is 1

   1 | name: report
>  2 | max_concurrent: 0
                       ^
   3 | steps:

   There is no value that means "never run". Remove the schedule, or pause the job,
   if that is what you want. 1 is the default and means what a flock wrapper around
   a cron line means: a second run waits rather than overlapping.

       max_concurrent: 1

   paceq error PQ1030  for the full explanation
